The folder contains scripts for installing the Wi-Fi Alliance's Certification
Test Suite's Linux DUT controller software to DUT and a script to start / stop
the DUT controller remotely.

Usage:
* Install: ./install.sh $DUT_HOST
* Run: ./wfa_ca_dut.sh start $DUT_HOST
* Stop: ./wfa_ca_dut.sh stop $DUT_HOST

Note that the SSH identity file used to connect to the DUT is not included.
The file, testing_rsa, can be found in
https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/chromite/+/master/ssh_keys#
and be placed in deploy folder with permission 600.
